amily of three after her marriage with Kazuto, but she was saddened because it became a dream which can never be realized."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43230"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明人が想いを寄せている義理の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーションもさることながら、家事、料理もできる完璧主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明人のことを溺愛しており、結婚を機に、夫と明人の３人で暮らせることを楽しみにしていたが、それが叶わぬ夢となって、悲しんでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7877","sourceWorkId":"22698","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明人が想いを寄せている義理の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーションもさることながら、家事、料理もできる完璧主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事先の医師（武雄の父）と関係を持ってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7877","sourceWorkId":"23868","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明人が想いを寄せている義理の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーションもさることながら、家事、料理もできる完璧主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明人を溺愛しており、結婚を機に夫と明人の三人で暮らすことを楽しみにしていたが、それが叶わぬ夢となり、悲しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もう大丈夫よ……。 お義姉ちゃんが、迎えに来ましたからね……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42961"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc60ee46bd7d5254c53a7bb19a0e77284c0d3c02ccd7fb577f107a8bbf3e28e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5f0ca3f07e5c0570d29b9a02e6d2abc3696893d88b0e51ae7015d87767b2677.webp","width":103,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:149220:42961:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c43231","characterName":"朝露 砂夜子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42962","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"149220"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7878"],"vndbCharact