"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母と自分を残して家を出ていった父を嫌っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7879","sourceWorkId":"22698","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有名な女学園に通う、美少女優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で運動もできて、外見も申し分なく、学園ではリーダー的な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"落ち込む武雄にイライラするも、放っておけずに口を出してしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7879","sourceWorkId":"23868","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有名な女学園に通う、美少女優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で運動もできて、外見も申し分なく、学園ではリーダー的な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母と自分を残して家を出ていった父を嫌っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明人とは幼少の頃に良く遊んでいたが、中学に入り、寮生活が始まると疎遠になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以来、一度も顔を合わせていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「明人さんと再会できたのは、偶然ではないと思います。 きっと、神様が与えてくださった運命だと……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42963"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9a20e08a365e240ba88cbaac5e885042ecb97c5a3140bbc9a5de775c8e104f4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b24c0796cfb585a8206efde59494c73e96fc25fcb6bef2543ec4b7f9151c472.webp","width":103,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天海玖美","creatorId":"vndb:s2832","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2832","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2832","name":"天海 玖美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:149220:42963:15998:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c43233","characterName":"神野 菫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42964","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"149220"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7880"],"vndbCharacterId":"c43233"},"originalCharacterName":"神野 菫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I told you before right? That I detest you.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The priestess of the temple near Akito's home and the mother of Ai."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's an enchanting cool beauty who has a gaze which seems to see through everything, as well as a pair of bountiful breasts. A kind, doting parent who always prioritizes her daughter over anything else."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She shows no mercy to any man who tries to come close to her daughter. Akito, the only person who Ai likes aside from her mother, is treated a little harshly by Sumire."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She needs to give birth to a man who can succeed the temple. However, her husband left the house and his whereabouts are currently unknown. Considering her age, conception is difficult and may soon become impossible, so her back is currently pressed against the wall."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43233"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家の近くにある神社の神主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"藍の母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全てを見透かすような眼差しと豊かなバストが悩ましいクールビューティー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘のことを溺愛しており、常に娘のことを第一に考える、優しい母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘に近づいてくる男供には容赦がなく、娘が自分以外に好意を寄せた唯一の相手である明人に対しても、少しきつく接することも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家を継がせるために、男の子を生まなくてはならないが、夫は家出して行方不明、年齢的にもギリギリということで、立場的に背水の陣である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7880","sourceWorkId":"22698","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家の近くにある神社の神主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"藍の母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全てを見透かすような眼差しと豊かなバストが悩ましいクールビューティー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘のことを溺愛しており、常に娘のことを第一に考える、優しい母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明人と子作りの儀式の真っ最中。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7880","sourceWorkId":"23868","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"藍の母親。 実家の近くにある神社の神主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全てを見透かすような眼差しと豊かなバストが悩ましいクールビューティー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘のことを溺愛しており、常に娘のことを第一に考える優しい母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘に近付く男に容赦がなく、娘が好意を寄せる明人に対して少しキツく接することも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家を継がせるために男の子を生まなくてはならないが、夫は行方不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢的にもギリギリということで、立場的に背水の陣である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「前にも言いましたでしょう？　私は、あなたの事が嫌いなのです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42964"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e69b66b06b15153c5185fc6c35299b921ec459bbff3eef1b94649fba29c247bf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccdc837da0111da7452d46a014a719fe3a9352c83b51f50bae75d3f6b0c6f7c7.webp","width":103,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:149220:42964:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46168","characterName":"大菊 ジュン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74495","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"11164"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13033"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46168"},"originalCharacterName":"大菊 ジュン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A candy shop manager. The usual item trader in the Tsuma series."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46168"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"マンションの大家。兼、アダルトショップの店長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前主人公がお気に入りで、香苗と結婚しているにも関わらず"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのアピールは続いているとか……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1階に飲食店が入ったからと、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の店の時間帯を変更してくれるあたりなど人の良いオヤジっぷりは健在。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13033","sourceWorkId":"2651