emely softhearted person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After his brother married Miyuri, the woman he loves, he quit university and left his hometown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He works with undivided attention to try and forget Miyuri, but even until now he still has lingering affection towards her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43234"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b446a4175b138706c6285ce5443a98c60a7a1ebae6f615a08c5cdc6f9ef795b4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cc2749204e2ef69310f9d6e5c838a1186514872d425c3121d8209750c3f82398.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c46161","characterName":"夏樹 和人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c46161"},"originalCharacterName":"夏樹 和人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The perfect brother of Akito, and the husband of Miyuri. A diligent office worker. Is more dense than Akito when it comes to women. He wants a child soon, and is talking about it with Miyuri."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46161"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e71bdea289824768e58fc4e398352756f2b7a95ad10adb42fe97168483f1d80.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/4146f8dc602900f56b81ef561deeb64917445bd813ee16686241bb851643339e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c46162","characterNam